#: scenario3:scenario3_B371B5B2_5FFF_454D_BA8B_595B70E93E11
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c8191f28e28d0dafdff952f9a6e864d009ef573c2b8882e05293f0c01cfd1f16
#. default-sha256: 5e8e90f44256a2dc29b855d1acd2262e4738fbf69466f0b979639cbff5a1e0d4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B371B5B2_5FFF_454D_BA8B_595B70E93E11"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Though she looked outwardly uncertain as Maria led her "
"forward, hand around her wrist, the White-Haired Girl seemed to be enjoying herself on the inside."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫De l’extérieur, on aurait dit que la Fille aux Cheveux Blancs "
"hésitait à suivre Maria, qui la guidait en lui tenant le poignet, mais en son for intérieur, elle "
"s’amusait."

#: scenario3:scenario3_96C33220_D592_454A_B65F_D0C71ABE015E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea2fa2f3f4f8adff9b307f1cc68d49bd056ec25b4798babe70421363a5e393d0
#. default-sha256: ec31dc03623f3130fd1790ba4be5a9e31cb724a4122235af53ad16f96563333d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_96C33220_D592_454A_B65F_D0C71ABE015E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Having spent her life without a single friend, she never dreamed the day would come when she "
"would find herself being dragged through the empty halls of a dark mansion by another woman."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Comme elle avait passé sa vie sans aucun ami, elle n’aurait jamais imaginé que le jour "
"viendrait où elle se retrouverait traînée par une autre femme dans les couloirs vides d’un manoir "
"sombre."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B03D2EAA_4E14_4CB5_A9AA_4080EB6B8B87
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ac883fcd01f36cc33c81b0efdc5506a411a583b74f808db41e8c6bb21bbb1408
#. default-sha256: 5128a56b7383ca411d7632f42bb758a718cc5b47dd4e8390e078271e6facb1ab
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B03D2EAA_4E14_4CB5_A9AA_4080EB6B8B87"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maria’s presence seemed to shine a light upon the quiet corridor;⟪k:1⟫it would have been a "
"very lonely trek without her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maria, par sa présence, illuminait le couloir silencieux ;⟪k:1⟫sans elle, ç’aurait été une "
"promenade très solitaire."

#: scenario3:scenario3_6B22A098_BBF3_42B9_A51D_965983BC3276
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 47159e7c1f230929b273f04cbfc542ed6cc78b0c2b294ef4e27b20bfd40a9787
#. default-sha256: 56d44075655eb1313051a321b9b4d9464b498878def2c54a163b31d3ed3c7402
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6B22A098_BBF3_42B9_A51D_965983BC3276"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maria spun around, gave an impish smirk, and raised her pointer finger to her lips with a "
"soft “shhh.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maria se retourna, lui sourit d’un air malicieux, posa son index sur ses lèvres et lui "
"souffla un léger « chut »."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D018C8FF_1783_4D5F_8135_D36CFD201481
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0c9ea519606a7617a87f70ea2ad40b76a6cb53da50bff9cc3bf0f5f5dba33dfd
#. default-sha256: cea844906c7d19fe9f3386c97eafabd63a79315e7aa7ebc5ab336e34a132e8b7
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D018C8FF_1783_4D5F_8135_D36CFD201481"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The sight of it caused the White-Haired Girl to chuckle quietly.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The two of them, "
"on their way to their secret, private ball,⟪k:3⟫were like two adolescent girls."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Cela fit rire la Fille aux Cheveux Blancs.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Elles ressemblaient toutes deux, en "
"allant à leur bal secret, privé, à deux adolescentes."

#: scenario3:scenario3_0A3870C9_338F_40B0_B7B4_6D14C7AB1CDF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 87d2b9eda111ead12568de8c796d28cde08144ab2f7eaebc26c93c476d26c6eb
#. default-sha256: b11cdb1f2158de3a4d8ee4bb618cdfcf00ffea9ed9942016481a22628a398cc6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0A3870C9_338F_40B0_B7B4_6D14C7AB1CDF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫In short order, they arrived at the great hall."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Elles arrivèrent en peu de temps au grand hall."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9F571970_3E45_4B4A_8C72_011F9E50A799
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5a7f840e6bd11bcb58e84e523370cefafc04018f620a1a2261db34a5fa113d86
#. default-sha256: 05f6de10ea6173838a7b521f5ac581e521acf12066a9442fffdf7eb4b8ada906
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9F571970_3E45_4B4A_8C72_011F9E50A799"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫M-⟪k:10⟫My heart was pounding all the way "
"here..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫M-⟪k:10⟫Mon cœur cognait dans ma poitrine tout "
"le long du trajet..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A3B0773F_61EB_42F7_9458_F05D7EADD71A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 021e2b20406d9ef9b7bcc901b656ff0692a9ee84eff5738aa3f17da515787745
#. default-sha256: 4ce47b4f05b201f8ac0bab3420e178e6f7fafbdb7b2115544e85b75c631a0412
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A3B0773F_61EB_42F7_9458_F05D7EADD71A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫What’s there to be nervous about?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫It’s not like you’re breaking any rules."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Et alors ? Pas de quoi être nerveuse !⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫C’est pas comme si on violait des "
"règles."

#: scenario3:scenario3_98B25F09_107D_47E3_9B12_B1FACF315A9D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 11236d38084cd3b9aeac2cbc3f64de30a5c79bbdb2dd46ef3c3c2401acef2761
#. default-sha256: 0df5ca05347e758df4cd050794393e587eb026ccc6cf4e5d4d1c3826da601a3f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_98B25F09_107D_47E3_9B12_B1FACF315A9D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Only kids get in trouble for staying up late!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Once you’ve grown up, you’re "
"responsible for yourself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫C’est les enfants qui ont chaud aux fesses quand ils veillent tard !⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Une fois "
"adulte, on peut faire ses propres choix."

#: scenario3:scenario3_74A56512_FC2F_438D_AC68_12043F3BEE23
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b20a5be543e0c3552bd213a7a0a1b6afaeca634066fec1a4e60018e7b4acf7a7
#. default-sha256: ff3f4e9d309072e479168eef300ec9794f9ab7751643f0bba430dcd5a6292c6e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_74A56512_FC2F_438D_AC68_12043F3BEE23"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hehe..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Héhé..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_5630319A_E42E_4BB9_993C_8890EEE2E419
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cbfa9f24456240435f466f2c77359ffa9f248b70003992f10e2e2b963755f3db
#. default-sha256: 8049670504ed0cad3149c0b1b5fa6a2afd6b354d1edc7294b78bab5c10205629
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5630319A_E42E_4BB9_993C_8890EEE2E419"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I will say, though, that it seems rather odd for two women to dance together."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Je dois dire, cependant, que cela me semble assez bizarre, que deux femmes dansent "
"ensemble."

#: scenario3:scenario3_22E7B308_3F8A_43FB_909B_4BF232C2BBBD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6992e2be92f4c3781705c9c19d9189740c90a83d73d31f936581975d6406baf1
#. default-sha256: ee4656f7e81939b2eef9cf636089957b33d5d7891496acb24da78dfbae2e57e8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_22E7B308_3F8A_43FB_909B_4BF232C2BBBD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh? If you’re having a good time, what does it matter what’s between your legs? ⟪k:2⟫"
"Where I come from, there’re dances where families lock arms in a big ring and go ’round in "
"circles."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ah ? Si vous passez un bon moment, qui se soucie de c’que vous avez entre les jambes ? "
"⟪k:2⟫Là d’où je viens, y a des danses où des familles entières se prennent par le bras et forment "
"de grandes rondes."

#: scenario3:scenario3_91608649_B4C7_49DA_B8D6_C1D554538A62
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 47e9a8bf821541fa415fa5497100af52918deef2d86bd7ed607d2aaee1e14a32
#. default-sha256: 75ce06befeaff8cc0de6070537991a5b184af106c74157aec76baeb49977b9c1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_91608649_B4C7_49DA_B8D6_C1D554538A62"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫So who says two girls can’t have some fun together?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Alors, qui a dit que deux filles ne pouvaient pas s’amuser ensemble ?!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_74DC1BB5_F7FE_4D6D_896C_47F8BA040F7E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4e6674bf4bbcf37d0348ed21d663e9811a8a2e13ae4aecfbaa2eb62355032383
#. default-sha256: 4020713bf5028a6188c7c725b6a5d39bcee9179c6af9a120fb55dacf998db9c8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_74DC1BB5_F7FE_4D6D_896C_47F8BA040F7E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I imagine you had many good moments with your family."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫J’imagine que vous avez passé de très bons moments avec votre famille."

#: scenario3:scenario3_6197179F_2AE7_4FD1_8DC5_4018C1690F18
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e2d5e8ca20f5badd3c8c0551425742363c1d74ef459a7fc77d95a6e7213643ed
#. default-sha256: 989fa6dd8137ab6dad0ef933d34d3f803c6a4b63219ccdccbe074cbd09ca1a7a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6197179F_2AE7_4FD1_8DC5_4018C1690F18"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Well... ⟪k:2⟫I don’t have a family anymore."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Eh bien... ⟪k:2⟫je n’ai plus de famille."

#: scenario3:scenario3_AD32D160_72C6_48A8_B74D_40637F3D35C2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0bec925910148b14e4aef1ee1332ef3de00afa8445c9ec708ac3c1b59cc7f44d
#. default-sha256: 7a2e81e045ec097c24312df7356529c2c4df678287cf8b57e80c3f66f126aef3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AD32D160_72C6_48A8_B74D_40637F3D35C2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫What...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Comment... ?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5DA78352_6D4A_40CD_A473_4534DF9A8168
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e6375dc067d18eb2ba1b74e094365267f8a965831d40b3dbee24b46d42325c12
#. default-sha256: 013853f4129f700fda1c510baef3316b45e12bd01f15f33233574e7286c1ef2a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5DA78352_6D4A_40CD_A473_4534DF9A8168"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫All right, so I’ll show you how it’s done.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Watch carefully, ’cause you’re up "
"next!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Bon, j’vous montre comment on s’y prend.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Regardez attentivement, parce "
"qu’après, c’est à vous !"

#: scenario3:scenario3_4DD16ADC_4FB9_4721_8CF2_8988C5C4C967
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 43ea9be4683e2482654bbf326b8a2d78f9788b4e76e0b1f1d76842c5a4460b37
#. default-sha256: e292168a1722ae15d269682b95321575358f36e8fde0a15d78732e0a0cd13f28
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4DD16ADC_4FB9_4721_8CF2_8988C5C4C967"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ah... ⟪k:2⟫o-⟪k:3⟫okay."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ah... ⟪k:2⟫d-⟪k:3⟫d’accord."

#: scenario3:scenario3_E18EA77E_74A9_4366_B4E6_101505AA7A55
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4ef1e38461706ebc02ed790c329350b8cb5fa72ae96713daca4e294fc538c247
#. default-sha256: 91ce9cbf331f2e6e7cfc92cc66a684ac2f4cedf6e22cfd93dd5cf7512340055e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E18EA77E_74A9_4366_B4E6_101505AA7A55"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫With a wide grin on her face, Maria began whistling softly and prancing "
"across the floor with an energetic rhythm."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫En affichant un grand sourire, Maria commença à siffloter et à sautiller sur "
"le sol d’un rythme soutenu."

#: scenario3:scenario3_80FCE4CE_1F91_4B28_8EB6_3061F2DDA2CC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0e9492485d6faba190d683220e7cc728d487afb474164b2b1f0d37b15f55525c
#. default-sha256: 95cc75b9f98185586d06ff67aeedd8730edac244baf75afbdf982e9d738c90ac
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_80FCE4CE_1F91_4B28_8EB6_3061F2DDA2CC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was not the kind of complicated dance you’d see at fancy parties."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ce n’était pas le genre de danses compliquées que l’on voit lors des soirées mondaines."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A817D415_E705_47F0_9D5F_AA7C63C87B16
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fe2568f868e9b43e4b7c75c5b7b18341c26524139afebf4c71cdd41888df6761
#. default-sha256: 3ed27123bb65c0faca28c49c9aa41150dbd2131cc985e1bc47aa3d11dcf3dde6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A817D415_E705_47F0_9D5F_AA7C63C87B16"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The motions were simple, flowing, unembellished—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫a folk dance, I suppose you "
"might call it.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫She seemed to be improvising a little bit as well."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Les mouvements étaient simples, fluides, naturels—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫je pense qu’on pourrait "
"appeler cela une danse populaire.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Elle avait aussi l’air d’improviser un peu."

#: scenario3:scenario3_BC8F8D24_6B49_44C2_A27C_CD4E18A8D890
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b3ed60e9066569e3a59ba753e1967cf38d26b0b6abb53d252d655829463fc09e
#. default-sha256: 55d0480b171f7817d6c2990f8881dd0783be1ca15c7c20e00daa13e44d859e46
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_BC8F8D24_6B49_44C2_A27C_CD4E18A8D890"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But in any event, the White-Haired Girl was captivated."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Quoi qu’il en soit, la Fille aux Cheveux Blancs était fascinée."

#: scenario3:scenario3_3350D509_3709_4309_B77D_4BE260D61F59
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ef4156bc522345f5ecab63faf99e269b756e6532d7a2cd83263dee6b5ab5b9c9
#. default-sha256: 27e865ebe3dbe9583e28d8fa79a3964fa2ee1b06aa7cf4bd131d0783219df7d6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3350D509_3709_4309_B77D_4BE260D61F59"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Despite it being a sequence of steps anyone could replicate,⟪k:1⟫Maria breathed life into "
"the dance."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Même si c’était une suite de pas que n’importe qui aurait pu reproduire, on voyait que Maria "
"insufflait de la vie à la danse."

#: scenario3:scenario3_AC32B8C2_19F3_40EC_84F6_5567F5E9D0C1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1c0e359a8aa51df90d713a89229a04e34757510ceacb9f52646a68720e10eec4
#. default-sha256: b39afb65497b8c1f65e5ccbce74ee840fdfc9c01d11ea0b895005800a81466ac
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AC32B8C2_19F3_40EC_84F6_5567F5E9D0C1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She was neither as lithe as an acrobat nor as light on her feet as a professional dancer."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Elle n’était pas aussi agile qu’une acrobate ; son pas n’était pas aussi léger qu’une "
"danseuse professionnelle."

#: scenario3:scenario3_478B7A2B_1580_4F75_97B3_84FF6131E8F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c8cbae2604fac8b5fb2f1ee6db59992e8fd1ee2c06a0396e615f180ac7920dca
#. default-sha256: 6e034b6ec861bb0809deea3882a90938c929e36d370cedb5556d0032321ec572
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_478B7A2B_1580_4F75_97B3_84FF6131E8F0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She was her own, lively, beautiful self."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Elle était elle-même, c’est-à-dire une jeune femme belle et pleine de vie."

#: scenario3:scenario3_FA632136_9FDF_4C20_90D0_C3102E2C1DA1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5e5f04cb5b1f2ee67d2edee2a7cd66df7f72cad16c83f1439bfee521354bbeb1
#. default-sha256: 64719ecdb49f024aa7b284c203cf330210bbf58320e776448b1d8a99a78b8446
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FA632136_9FDF_4C20_90D0_C3102E2C1DA1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maria twirled in place, the skirt of her maid uniform billowing gently up around her. ⟪k:1⟫"
"With a smile, she extended her hand toward the White-Haired Girl."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maria tournoya sur place et la jupe de son uniforme de servante se souleva délicatement sur "
"son sillage. ⟪k:1⟫Elle tendit la main en souriant vers la Fille aux Cheveux Blancs."

#: scenario3:scenario3_36EB736A_E234_4CDF_B995_8753F0AC28D6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dcfd46a9dea978053a22caba4b8a08daed76827f944ef9fbd96d9c268273db9d
#. default-sha256: bc5bad02a2d568e2198f8151af978e8a5dee9ca228dcfa6b35dd28d0b86f47ab
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_36EB736A_E234_4CDF_B995_8753F0AC28D6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She hesitated for a moment, but as if being pulled forward by some invisible force, she took "
"Maria’s hand."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Celle-ci hésita un instant puis, comme si une force invisible la poussait, elle prit la main "
"de Maria."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DCB77764_09BF_4F75_8804_A291D11383B4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fde75a064ce8d70a6500c48181db090c39634c9a09837306bb1ce37e6a83d334
#. default-sha256: bb52489f5f9851a72d30f09b443f457cd0c1b49d0c7b0757a3f77c400a461869
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DCB77764_09BF_4F75_8804_A291D11383B4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Hand-in-hand, Maria ushered the White-Haired Girl into her dance."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Tout en la guidant de la main, Maria la fit entrer dans la danse."

#: scenario3:scenario3_00E49622_54AE_41C1_A6DF_4391101C0ED5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f05468a42a79d41ccd3341e2e4597b0d55fc22904d2b840089bdce02d687d202
#. default-sha256: 1f66304a50f9123c1b0377933a4e90be945cc1af2d4fb9dc5c268d94e1d66d3d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_00E49622_54AE_41C1_A6DF_4391101C0ED5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was just the two of them, but you could almost see the crowd forming around them..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Elles étaient seules mais on pouvait très bien imaginer qu’une foule commençait à se former "
"autour d’elles..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_311AD7AE_688C_4BEA_97FF_A0B2E3E315FB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9e40913c7b7097297e4fde65ba10023e75bf11b8cde00069ccfff34dcd962c72
#. default-sha256: c378bbac50fa56355643c8534a99b34d764c26ba62c49210ef4a6b03a3a5858c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_311AD7AE_688C_4BEA_97FF_A0B2E3E315FB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫the other people stepping up to join in."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫...et que d’autres personnes s’apprêtaient à les rejoindre sur la piste."

#: scenario3:scenario3_153FE6BB_4F57_4B7C_BC7B_A0991FD49AAD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b15c388f3d52e203fd857bc4a6a725bbc0115c6afb1c2abba005c74b5277d17e
#. default-sha256: 7f2a2e865ba53a78e2f3f6c107da17855c13d8f5faa159931dbf47e7f773fd96
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_153FE6BB_4F57_4B7C_BC7B_A0991FD49AAD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That’s it, Madam. Doin’ great!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Now lift your leg up, good, and spin like so."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Voilà, madame. C’est super !⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Maint’nant levez la jambe, oui, et tournez comme ceci."

#: scenario3:scenario3_3DBBD0C0_88C4_4183_907D_F8AD8A80B9FC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 36a4fb315fa0f59e25b6092607cb7250d985d53aab53e79d45e8a12df5fe89b9
#. default-sha256: ea1d28bfa3edcb9752461b1124145ba987d9d73100dc8566fa87cdfcc2763aad
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3DBBD0C0_88C4_4183_907D_F8AD8A80B9FC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Th-⟪k:1⟫This is not easy, Maria.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I’m having trouble following along..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ce-⟪k:1⟫Ce n’est pas facile, Maria.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫J’ai du mal à vous suivre..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_ABA7A7A3_2BD1_45C2_AE14_9D976B6B00F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 176f26bb758221e64705a762ad5507d576443a9380482aa4527a5722a34b807c
#. default-sha256: 8b3e5d12e132968792989264181a4de10aa338c728330726959191828b9d079a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_ABA7A7A3_2BD1_45C2_AE14_9D976B6B00F0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You can do it!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Looking good so far!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You’re a natural, Madam!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Vous pouvez le faire !⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫V’vous en sortez bien !⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Vous êtes douée, madame !"

#: scenario3:scenario3_74103C2E_D0CD_4425_B338_E3C4B8B15E5D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ff81f2a54673b694bf50f378abc22796da70e0d4a39ba33a03c92644774d67d2
#. default-sha256: 6568447c41addd199574b4ad8435758506ef74398dde158d974e14570b3feab0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_74103C2E_D0CD_4425_B338_E3C4B8B15E5D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Oh, Maria...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I won’t fall for your flattery."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Oh, Maria...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ce n’est pas vrai, vous me flattez."

#: scenario3:scenario3_595B9CE1_E64A_4CC0_A787_63066803C4CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 59747c2d68ee86373defaa68fd9086027e7d16b2e5608bf6eccaaedf55d4580a
#. default-sha256: f42b25c971555c14c98eb9a21590f908326d93d6607cce3032b7b99e0d35a600
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_595B9CE1_E64A_4CC0_A787_63066803C4CD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I mean it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫J’le pense vraiment."

#: scenario3:scenario3_AF5831BE_12C1_44B1_98B0_CDC9025A6FA1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5e6d7af7cd639db42c28e44d80717e85125a281f833f4e6d337b165815aa285f
#. default-sha256: 8f02f2e0dbc9ece7b911110c56a7ab207cf76bbb21e435ccf28618c6ea20183e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AF5831BE_12C1_44B1_98B0_CDC9025A6FA1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The whispers of the two girls.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Their muffled laughs.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Step, hop, step, step."
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫The rustling of fabric."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Les murmures des deux filles.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Leurs rires étouffés.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Et un, et deux, hop, "
"et trois.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Le bruissement du tissu."

#: scenario3:scenario3_72879ED8_1640_418B_8308_591CED4EF744
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 72bf06cc15ad68dbc101ccbd42c04b4bedf6d014141b7fae0e751e5fca2d65d4
#. default-sha256: bd36e1ac86b8d18df03e5f2a6f33f70d7dc78c4deca45aabce6b04204a39e558
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_72879ED8_1640_418B_8308_591CED4EF744"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Many different soft sounds layered atop one another, creating a little bubble of happiness "
"in the center of the hall."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Une foule de petits bruits divers se combinaient les uns aux autres et créaient une petite "
"bulle de bonheur au centre du hall."

#: scenario3:scenario3_EE39CF84_5DCB_47C7_A6A2_5F1C6AB3E8F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b1cab34e9cff695abb4f8e93bd617db6d1b8aec7f47f7058817ce49cc199a179
#. default-sha256: 85344a813bfdbf7feb054e31ad6660c31a8e51a9bc16309352ceeb7ae583e51f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_EE39CF84_5DCB_47C7_A6A2_5F1C6AB3E8F0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl’s movements were a great deal clumsier than Maria’s, but Maria would "
"never disparage her for that."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Les mouvements de la Fille aux Cheveux Blancs étaient bien plus maladroits que ceux de "
"Maria, mais ce n’était pas Maria qui le lui ferait remarquer."

#: scenario3:scenario3_5E4E99D2_C126_495A_BBC6_DD8367B68CD9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a40413ff6cd7f35f71b1b11076ce2071368f913cfa16f3d1efef16f8a58f24b6
#. default-sha256: 3376064d4d70030e5aeb6776dc2d70ae4b9f6f01d1a352cd06f94bdcf7748a02
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5E4E99D2_C126_495A_BBC6_DD8367B68CD9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫On the contrary, she showered her with praise. ⟪k:1⟫As flustered as the White-Haired Girl "
"appeared, I imagine she was quite pleased."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Au contraire, elle ne tarissait pas d’éloges. ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫À⟪k:3⟫ voir le trouble de la Fille "
"aux Cheveux Blancs, je pense qu’elle devait être vraiment contente."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F25A50BD_5B57_4304_9AE4_E0B21F00561E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 34de323947d4ea9012bd68d57df1fe1faf603677121b0c5e1e3dce9c891b8072
#. default-sha256: ee069c8b23d3e323b1566267636f1072f1e06f59e65b68ee551e8fec503f460f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F25A50BD_5B57_4304_9AE4_E0B21F00561E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Before long, the tightness in her face muscles loosened, a smile spread across her lips, and "
"she began to brighten up."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Rapidement, les muscles de son visage se détendirent, un sourire illumina son visage et elle "
"se sentit mieux."

#: scenario3:scenario3_492CA4CA_48E8_4150_946D_F4B39F9B207D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c7573e8321fbd66119098ba4a35da0b1e9b00eab8d9fb46200a24affb6b7540b
#. default-sha256: be6e20d51b3b822854d62d8c9d680b8bb6ff7d3f94fa57a2d53a8e2e54742b0e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_492CA4CA_48E8_4150_946D_F4B39F9B207D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫See?⟪k:1⟫What’d I tell ya?⟪k:2⟫Fun, huh?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Voyez ?⟪k:1⟫Qu’est-ce qu’j’vous avais dit ?⟪k:2⟫C’est marrant, hein ?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_EFF7A002_53EC_4B9F_B5AA_580D15A808BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3a1ca2ae0d59ddb56f29f96b7d2a7fed0eaf3f6c21dc7f45b403ae0ebca2e137
#. default-sha256: 96799a69f7dfc94fcc5293fb0e1eebac98d9fd1b24cd5036e4c71f00335ec94f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_EFF7A002_53EC_4B9F_B5AA_580D15A808BC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Yes. I am quite surprised—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫both that I ⟪k:4⟫can⟪k:5⟫ dance and that I enjoy "
"doing it so much."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Oui. Je suis très surprise—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫non seulement de voir que je ⟪k:4⟫peux⟪k:5⟫ danser "
"mais aussi que cela me plaît autant."

#: scenario3:scenario3_2D87F38D_28F3_4B87_8405_FCD8A13C39B6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5262d9bb91aaab504026d30859d9b0539a9a9b30ad0b1d078ce9540840ea45ce
#. default-sha256: b2cf450d3f1bde8eac98db4bb07217dc36166e2f9efe476172e5b82a7aa66489
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2D87F38D_28F3_4B87_8405_FCD8A13C39B6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Hahah! Glad to hear it!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Hahaha ! Heureuse de l’apprendre !"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C4F380E4_755E_4CE7_BBD6_18E9B3510388
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 95ba745eef4d0c4165132cc44ef0e9db2354b5ed7166bfe5e745a1ef67717041
#. default-sha256: a55f015aee2a9cf3400f13dfc059b893b97a0092b09fa8415fbb42e6a0506510
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C4F380E4_755E_4CE7_BBD6_18E9B3510388"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They exchanged looks and both laughed. ⟪k:1⟫That might have been the first time I had ever "
"seen the White-Haired Girl so delighted."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Elles échangèrent un regard et se mirent à rire. ⟪k:1⟫C’était peut-être la première fois que "
"je voyais la Fille aux Cheveux Blancs aussi ravie."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9FF8CF68_2DCB_4081_A2D6_4674035B5010
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2fc49a49feb3648ca1dc0afe6e0bb7d776453a65a4ac263c6857cd86d2642a95
#. default-sha256: 0e28bfa697ddfa240bb8b0e5b28820da5298b7f7e41007e8f01658de2736ce16
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9FF8CF68_2DCB_4081_A2D6_4674035B5010"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫However, because of her infirmity, she quickly found herself out of breath, her porcelain "
"skin flushed red."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Cependant, à cause de son handicap, elle se retrouva vite à bout de souffle et son teint "
"porcelaine devint rouge vif."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A176BBA4_5C5B_4D0C_87E1_CAE5C1779EB4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f51a8b911fe2a1fc47e80855bc905e6b585ec88029bb48d26cf011791b1d0cda
#. default-sha256: d164c91961dbb68c5b5f070234f9daf241c14b168c1ee9877c6485f30373ab2f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A176BBA4_5C5B_4D0C_87E1_CAE5C1779EB4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Maria immediately stopped for a break."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Maria s’arrêta aussitôt pour faire une pause."

#: scenario3:scenario3_CBBB1F31_D4FC_46C4_9F32_5D62A4853939
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 421f8f3629dc70770f2bea53ce932a738ae13eb06930495cf765f8e484411911
#. default-sha256: c9eccc7513d6b9940bbac1ae31abc386510bfab18725751e4579a8ffbeb16e5e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_CBBB1F31_D4FC_46C4_9F32_5D62A4853939"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She could surely have continued dancing for some time yet, but Maria was conscientious of "
"the White-Haired Girl’s physical condition."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Elle aurait pu continuer à danser encore un bon moment, mais Maria était consciente de la "
"condition physique de la Fille aux Cheveux Blancs."

#: scenario3:scenario3_4BD5B9AC_1407_4118_9077_28D9615E3102
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 92c2c56c9efb078a8d411d429ecc39d2cc7294bfabca2a4e280170590d63b2e2
#. default-sha256: bb200fc49420d143f642ee70f810a91c7f98714d49e62cc0a0675aa106986351
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4BD5B9AC_1407_4118_9077_28D9615E3102"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She looked over at Maria regretfully."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Elle jeta un regard de regret à Maria."

#: scenario3:scenario3_AA806ABD_A17D_4C0B_B0DC_407908E135F7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ce5349d97927471bfe55f1ae619e1d961940303ac894d7b7a3a07a735d3ca7a5
#. default-sha256: 712ea6704b006e24b6cf26e4df64d47c337a27a8a19610f54048bdadb33c943b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AA806ABD_A17D_4C0B_B0DC_407908E135F7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫My apologies. If only I had more stamina...⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫I am "
"hardly a suitable partner for you, Maria."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Mes excuses. Si seulement j’avais plus d’endurance...⟪k:8⟫"
"⟪k:9⟫Je ne suis pas la partenaire qu’il vous faut, Maria."

#: scenario3:scenario3_6A6F6A03_1B55_4CCC_BC45_D93B45B6135C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3d15ece36cba21b693a82748be1075aa6e83d4c930364ac2ac7df175ee8e6594
#. default-sha256: a0d190048e8ea11135051cc0f0a2ff865b28c2972283664096dd3c11953f882c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6A6F6A03_1B55_4CCC_BC45_D93B45B6135C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Sure you are! ⟪k:2⟫This is all to cheer you up, Madam,⟪k:3⟫so as long as you’re having "
"fun, nothing else matters!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Bien sûr que si ! ⟪k:2⟫Tout ça, c’est pour vous r’monter l’moral, madame,⟪k:3⟫alors "
"tant qu’vous vous amusez, c’est tout c’qui compte !"

#: scenario3:scenario3_016A6001_C3DB_41FA_86C0_32021741B8A3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1532df7cb9af0678fde4487e5c0b3790aad2ac3ba50637fe2425a137bb48350b
#. default-sha256: 2f6400353e4653c6ff4e59f467115050f5277975957d80443a2c73ea1b2e8da4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_016A6001_C3DB_41FA_86C0_32021741B8A3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And heck, I’m enjoying myself plenty too.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Whaddya think, wouldn’t it be nice to do "
"this again sometime?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Et pis mince, moi aussi j’m’amuse comme une p’tite folle.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ce serait pas mal de "
"recommencer un de ces quatre, qu’en dites-vous ?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_F218979F_B579_49C7_9FF9_A2F50ED63BA4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5348a3b40fe23675815d2bfddd089fa382255754ecc41e3938bb6e2247391221
#. default-sha256: 9ec6a26ad74090b5566a2ad9b8f9768c00fe9ec37281028a1ab9bf1fc1e9a3a3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F218979F_B579_49C7_9FF9_A2F50ED63BA4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Whenever you’re feeling down, let’s dance."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Dès qu’vous vous sentez déprimée, dansons."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A51D2C92_2001_4BA7_9EDD_D985CF66B96A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
